    {
      "source": "<code>index</code> element on the <code>@N1qlJoin</code> can be used to provided the hint for the <code>lks</code> (current entity) index and <code>rightIndex</code>\nelement can be used to provided the <code>rks</code> (associated entity) index.",
      "translation": "<code>index</code> 元素在 <code>@N1qlJoin</code> 中可用于为 <code>lks</code>（当前实体）索引和 <code>rightIndex</code> 元素提供提示，后者则用于指定 <code>rks</code>（关联实体）的索引。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Associated entities can be lazily fetched upon the first access of the property, this could save on fetching more data than required when loading the entity.\nTo load the associated entities lazily, <code>@N1qlJoin</code> annotation’s element <code>fetchType</code>\nhas to be set to <code>FetchType.LAZY</code>.\nThe default is <code>FetchType.IMMEDIATE</code>.",
      "translation": "关联实体可以在首次访问属性时进行懒加载，这可以在加载实体时避免获取多余的数据。  \n若要懒加载关联实体，需将 `<code>@N1qlJoin</code>` 注解的元素 `<code>fetchType</code>` 设置为 `<code>FetchType.LAZY</code>`。  \n默认值为 `<code>FetchType.IMMEDIATE</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the join type is going to be hash join, the hash side can be specified for the <code>rks</code> (associated entity).\nIf the associated entity is on the build side, it can be specified as <code>HashSide.BUILD</code> else <code>HashSide.PROBE</code>.",
      "translation": "如果连接类型为哈希连接，则可以指定 `<code>rks`（关联实体）的哈希侧。如果关联实体位于构建侧，则将其指定为 `<code>HashSide.BUILD</code>`；否则指定为 `<code>HashSide.PROBE</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>keys</code> element on the <code>@N1qlJoin</code> annotation can be used to specify unique document keys to restrict the join key space.",
      "translation": "@N1qlJoin 注解上的 <code>keys</code> 元素可用于指定唯一文档键，以限制连接键空间。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This chapter describes hows ANSI joins can be used across entities.\nSince 5.5 version, Couchbase server provides support for ANSI joins for joining documents using fields.\nPrevious versions allowed index &amp; lookup joins, which were supported in SDC only by querying directly through the SDK.",
      "translation": "本章介绍了如何在实体之间使用 ANSI JOIN。自 5.5 版本起，Couchbase Server 支持通过字段连接文档的 ANSI JOIN。之前的版本仅支持索引查找连接（index &amp; lookup joins），且仅在 SDC 中可通过直接查询 SDK 来支持该功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Relationships between entities across repositories can be one to one or one to many.\nBy defining such relationships, a synchronized view of associated entities can be fetched.",
      "translation": "跨存储库的实体之间的关系可以是“一对一”或“一对多”。通过定义此类关系，可以获取关联实体的同步视图。",
      "count": 1
    },
